# Note on .meta files: Unity .meta files MUST be committed. They carry the
# GUIDs that link assets, scripts, and ScriptableObjects together. If a
# .meta file is missing, Unity generates a new GUID and references break.
# This ignore file deliberately does not exclude *.meta.
